===============================================================================
DATA SOURCES
===============================================================================

This licence covers the application code only. Data remains under its own terms.

  Air quality and dust
    Open-Meteo Air Quality API · air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality
    Underlying: Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS) global
    atmospheric composition forecast, ~40 km grid, four runs daily
    Published by: ECMWF on behalf of the European Commission
    Licence: Open-Meteo CC BY 4.0 · CAMS data under the Copernicus licence

  Weather
    Open-Meteo Weather Forecast API · api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast
    Underlying: ECMWF IFS and national weather service models
    Licence: CC BY 4.0

  Base mapping
    CARTO basemaps (Voyager, Positron) · basemaps.cartocdn.com
    OpenStreetMap standard tiles · tile.openstreetmap.org
    Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0
    Cartography © CARTO, CC BY 3.0

  Satellite imagery
    Esri World Imagery · server.arcgisonline.com/ArcGIS/rest/services/World_Imagery
    Imagery © Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, CNES/Airbus DS
    Licence: Esri terms of use

  Mapping library
    Leaflet 1.9.4 · BSD 2-Clause

  Health guidelines
    WHO Global Air Quality Guidelines 2021, ISBN 978-92-4-003422-8

  Cadastral and land parcel data
    NOT USED. No plot boundaries, title parcels, land ownership or zoning
    polygons appear anywhere. Base maps show roads, building footprints and
    place names, which are not legal land parcels. Qatari parcel geometry is
    held by the Ministry of Municipality (Survey and Land Registration
    Department) and the Centre for Geographic Information Systems
    (gisportal.gov.qa). Neither publishes it openly.

===============================================================================
ASSUMPTIONS
===============================================================================

The sample dataset is constructed for demonstration. It is not measurement and
must not be presented as such. All 32 assumptions are listed on the
"Data & Method" page.
